  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 500eb</p>\n<p>An AI based off the very old Tim Allen character from the show Home Improvement. Provides decent mechanic advise for just about anything, from cyberware to aircraft. Provides a +1 to all skills with the word \"Tech\" in their name.</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>An app runs on a Neuroport or an Agent and does nothing without one (see the House Rules journal). Keep it in the inventory while the character has either.</li>\n<li>The +1 applies automatically to every skill with \"Tech\" in its name: Air, Land, and Sea Vehicle Tech, Basic Tech, Cybertech, Electronics/Security Tech, and Weaponstech.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From Bontari Homebrew Cyberpunk Items by Bontari (Apps).</em></p>"
